       "The median is the value dividing ordered data into two equal parts — the (N+1)/2th item.",
       "For odd N the median is the middle item; for even N it is the average of the two middle items.",
       "The mode is the value occurring most frequently — 'the value with maximum frequency'.",
       "Geometric mean (GM) suits averages of rates–percentages; harmonic mean (HM) suits speed–rates.",
