       "Consumer equilibrium is where MU = price (for one good); the maximum satisfaction point.",
       "The equi-marginal utility rule: MUx/Px = MUy/Py — equal marginal utility from each rupee.",
       "An indifference curve (IC) shows combinations of two goods yielding equal satisfaction.",
